    {"type":"V","evidence":"must be clocked simultaneously 602 times","rewrite":"During a single image transfer operation, a logic analyzer shall capture ≥602 rising edges on CLK_IMG and ≥602 rising edges on CLK_STORE, with inter-clock skew per edge pair measured ≤1.5 ns; the test passes only if both edge counts equal 602 and all 602 skew measurements satisfy the bound."}
  ]
}

